{
  "tab": "skill_costs",
  "note": "NOTE: Each rank costs the material recipe PLUS the matching essence (the main power gate) PLUS Copper Coin. Rank 1 is listed. For rank r > 1, quantity = round(rank_1_qty × 1.6^(r-1)). Costs scale by power/tier: basic < nature < elemental < spiritual, and within a class the stronger skill costs more (Flame Cleave / Firebolt > Earthbreaker / Thorn Bind; Holy Light is the most expensive). Basic (all): Monster Essence 30, Training Scroll 5, Copper Coin 20. Nature: Thorn Bind is a bit cheaper (NE 35); Earthbreaker and Venom Strike use NE 40 + Nature commons + Holy Dust (cross-category) + Stone Chunk/Branch. Elemental bulk is Earth Grit (not Twig/Wool), plus Soul Dust (cross-category) and a shard; Lightning Dash EE 50, Flame Cleave/Firebolt EE 60. Spiritual: Soul Guard/Shadow Mark SE 65; Holy Light SE 75. Rare drops are milestones at ranks 5 and 10 only (unchanged). Placeholders; to be tuned. v0.1.3: Nature recipes no longer ask for Holy Dust (spirit) or Earth Crystal (elemental) — they use Pebble/Wool/Fur and Heartwood. Elemental recipes no longer ask for Soul Dust or Holy Essence — they use Earth Shard and Fire Crystal / Earth Crystal. Spiritual recipes are unchanged (Holy Dust, Soul Dust, Holy Essence, Soul Shard). Shared materials (copper, bark, grit, stones) still mix across ranks. v0.2.1: Root Lash and Dig In rank-1 recipes (Dry Root, Tough Root, Nature Essence). A row at rank r > 1 is either a milestone rare or a mixed-in material; if it names a rank-1 material it overrides the scaled qty (Earthbreaker r2 Twig 40 instead of 56). Earthbreaker r2 adds Dry Root 20; Flame Cleave r3 adds Tough Root 2. Rank 1 of early skills stays on pasture mats.  v0.2.3: Power Strike rank-1 Monster Essence is 20 (was 30). Further ranks still scale from the rank-1 qty (r2 = 32).  v0.2.6: Power Strike, Rage, Earthbreaker, Root Lash, Flame Cleave and Dig In have an explicit recipe at every rank 1-10 (no 1.6× scaling, amounts 10-40, no Heartwood/Log). Parked skills keep the old scaled rows.",
